{"4712460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grinny’s Playhouse", "steam_appid": 4712460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Grinny’s Playhouse, a once‑lively children’s fun centre now abandoned after its mysterious shutdown. Explore the dark party rooms and uncover what happened here. But be careful… the mascot who once entertained families hasn’t fully powered down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/475ba641776594f5f3c0c834b9b9a2c5.avif?t=1780866011\" width=350 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Grinny's Playhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grinny’s Playhouse was once a thriving children’s fun centre—until a series of strange reports from parents and staff forced an immediate shutdown. Rumours spread of unusual noises after closing hours, missing equipment, and the mascot behaving… incorrectly. The building was sealed overnight, and no official explanation was ever given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/f6dfdc249861808aa0eb2ab926ff39ac.poster.avif?t=1780866011\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/f6dfdc249861808aa0eb2ab926ff39ac.webm?t=1780866011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/f6dfdc249861808aa0eb2ab926ff39ac.mp4?t=1780866011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles Hidden Throughout the Playhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to solve a variety of puzzles scattered across the playhouse. Follow clues, interact with the environment, and unlock new areas as you progress. Each puzzle brings you closer to uncovering the truth behind Grinny’s Playhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/34377e9b5df8466f3d3224592a21d776.poster.avif?t=1780866011\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/34377e9b5df8466f3d3224592a21d776.webm?t=1780866011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/34377e9b5df8466f3d3224592a21d776.mp4?t=1780866011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore Grinny's Playhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through the abandoned party rooms, corridors, and hidden corners of the once‑popular fun centre. Bright colours hide a darker past, and every space holds traces of what was left behind. The deeper you go, the more the playhouse reveals — and the more you realise something inside never fully shut down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Grinny’s Playhouse, a once‑lively children’s fun centre now abandoned after its mysterious shutdown. Explore the dark party rooms and uncover what happened here. But be careful… the mascot who once entertained families hasn’t fully powered down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/475ba641776594f5f3c0c834b9b9a2c5.avif?t=1780866011\" width=350 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Grinny's Playhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grinny’s Playhouse was once a thriving children’s fun centre—until a series of strange reports from parents and staff forced an immediate shutdown. Rumours spread of unusual noises after closing hours, missing equipment, and the mascot behaving… incorrectly. The building was sealed overnight, and no official explanation was ever given.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/f6dfdc249861808aa0eb2ab926ff39ac.poster.avif?t=1780866011\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/f6dfdc249861808aa0eb2ab926ff39ac.webm?t=1780866011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/f6dfdc249861808aa0eb2ab926ff39ac.mp4?t=1780866011\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles Hidden Throughout the Playhouse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits to solve a variety of puzzles scattered across the playhouse. Follow clues, interact with the environment, and unlock new areas as you progress. Each puzzle brings you closer to uncovering the truth behind Grinny’s Playhouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/34377e9b5df8466f3d3224592a21d776.poster.avif?t=1780866011\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4712460/extras/34377e9b5df8466f3d3224592a21d776.webm?t=1780866011\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared